<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-03T09:46:53.115Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 09:46:53 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army has repeatedly shot down drones entering Sudanese airspace from Ethiopia, including an FH-95 drone over West Kordofan, while the Rapid Support Forces continue drone strikes on Sudan's power infrastructure, damaging stations in the east and causing widespread outages. Displaced civilians in South Darfur's Kalma camp face imminent famine as food and medicine run out. The Sudanese government has lodged formal complaints against Ethiopia at the UN Security Council and the African Union over the cross-border drone attacks. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168703&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxONzRGVHdVb1U0ckxCRUZwZW5MX1hyZExrU0RwbFV3SEZfRVlzQ3dQRmJ2NFpiMEVHNFNfU1pXSlR0aEhPWkdlMGlMY0YxalNxNG4yeERHME9qWmJUc1hkVDJobVl1SHVsX3NlS1N6YWtHWnVqejdCQzNpOEZQMkotWWQxTkJIaHU0YWxhdmQ5aWhlSWFPNnd5RnZzZU83Q1VZa29udXdzbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;OCHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxQeExNOWxndXRVVXptR3NFMHV1cXRSN051YkNOYlRCWDNEQV91MldCY2djVG1WN1JpQVd3RmdIT3hSSl9WNmFDZm1DUVJ4Uk5BRjhZNktJMWUtWlZGb2lNLXF5YlVPaUpNclQtOEprdjNMaWhWR1FWWTJudkVaQXlpeQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;m.aliran.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxNOVhwQlJBcU9JV0RiT055UDI1eGplR0pDUy1NN2ROSktzZFFZUE96cE9rT1RITm16UUZlVm4yWW9fa3lnUUpUS3IyUl95c09CaXJRazlJUjM1VGFlODBKYm1VN0dfOEJfYXl3NUlFTHVCMzBJWEJXUnV5eVdfTVVwVmZSSWlISXUxUENfRTREdnlFQ2gwN0RYQllJS2JpTG8xNWFVZUxVdHlxRkoxOUFvbk9xVHdXbzVFSWM2X1MxRTk?oc=5&quot;&gt;ASHARQ AL-AWSAT English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.c